  "details": "1. Clone a copy of the FinalIK Robot test avatar I curated. Avatar ID: avtr_9b4a9788-2423-4b49-8ca6-ef075230a3ca\n\n2. Have a second VRChat client watch the avatar remotely.\n\n3. Toggle Arm IK under avatar expressions menu.\n\nLinked is a video demonstrating the LimbIK component properly following the hand as expected on the remote client, but not for the local client. Instead, the local client sees the IK tracking to where the target would be in its resting pose.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/iWUGzNZz3zw",
